211 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 114 0 R/E(The filtered CSI data is transformed into time\205frequency spectrograms, which serve as compact and discriminative feature representations the Spectrogram Characteristics consists of  Time \(CSI sample index\) in x- axis is about 400 samples and Y axis consists of  Subcarrier index \(frequency bins\) that are 52 Wi Fi OFDM data subcarriers. The Pixel intensity: Normalized CSI magnitude also the Image resolution is 52 \327 400 pixels. Each spectrogram frame is generated directly from CSI magnitude, without interpolation or resizing, ensuring a one to one correspondence between CSI samples and image pixels.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[14]>>
endobj

