328 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 121 0 R/E(The transmitter consists of a standard 2.4 GHz Wi-Fi router configured to continuously transmit Wi-Fi packets such as beacon frames and data frames. These packets act as the carrier signal that propagates through the environment and interacts with surrounding objects and human motion.)/Pg 20 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

